| File | Key finding |
|---|---|
| `model_comparison_readmission.csv` | GB best: Acc=0.691 F1=0.691 |
| `model_comparison_discharge.csv` | LR best Acc, RF best F1 |
| `feature_importance_*.csv` | Top-10 ranked features per task |
| `ablation_study_readmission.csv` | +patient features → F1: 0.619→0.648 |

### Ablation Study Results
| Variant | F1 | AUC |
|---|---|---|
| Base (raw features) | 0.619 | 0.656 |
| + los_squared | 0.615 | 0.658 |
| + ed_visits_rate | 0.613 | 0.654 |
| + weekday_binary | 0.610 | 0.654 |
| + patient features (Full) | **0.648** | **0.687** |

> Patient demographics (age, sex, insurance) provide the most meaningful uplift.

